WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:05.923
(Wind blowing) 

00:00:05.923 --> 00:00:07.674
(Echoing knock)

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:08.258
(Footstep)

00:00:09.885 --> 00:00:10.886
(Echoing knock)

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:13.305
Lord Macbeth:
Hear it not, Duncan, for it is a
knell.

00:00:13.305 --> 00:00:13.931
(Knife unsheathing)

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:15.432
(Footstep)

00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:17.059
Lord Macbeth:
That summons thee to heaven...

00:00:17.059 --> 00:00:18.143
(Door opening)

00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:20.187
Lord Macbeth:
...or to hell.

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:22.648
(Echoing knock)

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:23.357
(Knock)

00:00:23.357 --> 00:00:24.399
(Choking sound)

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:26.360
(Echoing knock)

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:27.319
(Knock)  

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:30.197
(Echoing knock)

00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:30.781
(Knock)

